.Dd @MAN_DATE@
.Dt GLYPHASTORE_INSPECT_SEGMENT 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm glyphastore_inspect_segment
.Nd inspect a GlyphaStore durable Segment file
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl hV
.Op Fl Fl json
.Op Fl Fl no-scan
.Ar segment-file
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
performs read-only validation of one durable Segment file for GlyphaStore
.Sy @PROJECT_VERSION@ .
It does not take the Store directory lock and does not modify the file.
.Pp
Default work:
.Bl -enum -compact
.It
Open as a private, singly linked, owner-only regular file of exactly 64 MiB.
.It
Decode the Segment header and select the newest valid commit slot.
.It
When the basename is a canonical
.Pa segment-<id>.glypha
name, require it to match header identity.
.It
Scan the committed Record extent (CRC32C, sequences, commit metadata) unless
.Fl Fl no-scan .
.El
.Pp
A concurrent writer can make a point-in-time read observe a torn commit slot;
that is reported as validation failure (fail-closed), not success.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl Fl help
Show help and exit 0.
.It Fl V , Fl Fl version
Show version and exit 0.
.It Fl Fl json
Emit a stable single-line JSON object on stdout.
.It Fl Fl no-scan
Validate header and commit metadata only.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
Validated.
.It 1
Validation or I/O failure.
.It 2
Usage error.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr glyphastore 7 ,
.Xr glyphastore_verify_store 1
.Sh AUTHORS
GlyphaStore contributors.
